      "content": "hey my 4 year old son has a really high fever like 102.8 and he's being so fussy. i have some infant liquid acetaminophen at home but i don't know how much to give him cuz he's a big kid. he weighs about 42 lbs. the bottle says 160mg per 5ml. how many ml should i give him right now? i'm kinda panicking",
